Version 1.1.0
Date: 2026-08-03

Corrections
- Cleaned up `src/core/Core.php` and fixed the corrupted `http_json_input()` signature.
- Fixed controller view rendering to load templates from the root `views/` directory instead of `src/views/`.
- Hardened the router bootstrap so routes can be registered and matched even when the router is not pre-instantiated.
- Improved controller dispatch fallback so routes targeting controller methods can still resolve cleanly.
- Added JSON `Content-Type` on 404 responses for consistent API output.

Tests
- Updated the router dispatch test to target the probe controller instead of the router class itself.
- Verified the test suite passes after the fixes.

Notes for release
- This update focuses on bug fixes and runtime stability.
- No public API breakage was introduced.
